  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_01",
      "hash64": "C4A6708980CF29D9",
      "text": "Bonjour, tout le monde. Aujourd’hui encore,\\nessayons d’apprendre en nous amusant ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_02",
      "hash64": "C4A66D8980CF24C0",
      "text": "Est-ce que vous aimez bien lire l’horoscope ?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_03",
      "hash64": "C4A66E8980CF2673",
      "text": "En ce qui me concerne, consulter mon horoscope\\nle matin me met toujours de bonne humeur,\\r\\nsi la chance est avec moi, bien sûr ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_04",
      "hash64": "C4A6738980CF2EF2",
      "text": "Alors j’aimerais que notre cours d’aujourd’hui\\ntourne autour de la chance et de certains\\r\\nnombres qui y sont liés ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_05",
      "hash64": "C4A6748980CF30A5",
      "text": "J’imagine qu’il vous est tous déjà arrivé de faire\\nou recevoir un coup critique pendant un combat.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_06",
      "hash64": "C4A6718980CF2B8C",
      "text": "Lorsqu’on fait un coup critique, les dégâts\\ninfligés sont augmentés de moitié.\\c\\nEn d’autres termes, ils sont multipliés par 1,5.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_07",
      "hash64": "C4A6728980CF2D3F",
      "text": "Hélas, pour faire un coup critique, on ne peut\\ns’en remettre qu’à notre bonne fortune.\\c\\nC’est le fruit du hasard, mais c’est aussi ça qui\\nfait le sel des combats ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 165,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_08",
      "hash64": "C4A6778980CF35BE",
      "text": "Alors dites-moi, est-ce que vous connaissez\\nles chances de faire un coup critique ?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_b_03_select_01",
      "hash64": "7C8CF0001D8940DF",
      "text": "Environ 1 % (une fois sur cent).",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_b_03_select_02",
      "hash64": "7C8CF1001D894292",
      "text": "Environ 4 % (quatre fois sur cent).",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_b_03_select_03",
      "hash64": "7C8CF2001D894445",
      "text": "Environ 12 % (douze fois sur cent).",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_answer_01",
      "hash64": "367A6F7BC753DC72",
      "text": "Hi hi, non ! Même les coups critiques touchent\\nun petit peu plus souvent que ça.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_answer_02",
      "hash64": "367A6E7BC753DABF",
      "text": "C’est exactement ça !\\nBravo, [VAR 0x0100(0000)] ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_answer_03",
      "hash64": "367A6D7BC753D90C",
      "text": "Hi hi, non ! S’ils touchaient aussi souvent,\\nça serait peut-être un petit peu trop critique ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_09",
      "hash64": "C4A6788980CF3771",
      "text": "Pour être exacte, vous avez une chance sur\\nvingt-quatre. En pourcentage, c’est 4,17 %.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_10",
      "hash64": "C4A9F58980D241AF",
      "text": "Cependant, certaines capacités ont plus\\nde chances de faire un coup critique.\\c\\nPar exemple, Lame de Roc et Griffe Ombre ont\\n12 % de chances d’en faire un.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 156,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_11",
      "hash64": "C4A9F48980D23FFC",
      "text": "Vous pouvez également augmenter vos chances\\nde faire un coup critique par d’autres moyens.\\c\\nPar exemple, si vous utilisez une capacité comme\\nPuissance ou un objet comme Muscle +...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 182,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_12",
      "hash64": "C4A9F78980D24515",
      "text": "... Eh bien, figurez-vous que vous augmenterez\\nvos chances de coup critique de deux niveaux.\\r\\nVous atteindrez alors 50 % de chances ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_13",
      "hash64": "C4A9F68980D24362",
      "text": "Évidemment, c’est toujours plus agréable de\\nfaire un coup critique que d’en être la victime.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_14",
      "hash64": "C4A9F18980D23AE3",
      "text": "Quand on étudie les combats Pokémon, on se\\nrend compte qu’ils sont riches en probabilités.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_15",
      "hash64": "C4A9F08980D23930",
      "text": "Vous pouvez apprendre à les calculer afin\\nde provoquer la chance.\\c\\nVous élargirez ainsi l’éventail de vos stratégies\\net augmenterez peut-être vos chances de gagner.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 166,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_16",
      "hash64": "C4A9F38980D23E49",
      "text": "Oh, dommage ! C’est déjà la fin du cours...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_17",
      "hash64": "C4A9F28980D23C96",
      "text": "La prochaine fois, vous aurez un contrôle partiel !\\c\\nJ’espère que vous vous amuserez autant\\nà répondre aux questions que moi à les préparer.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
